principal sign-ins.

227
00:14:33.333 --> 00:14:37.957
And you saw a ring enforced only with
the D N five decision, the allow-enforce

228
00:14:37.957 --> 00:14:42.432
switch and the reviewed summary, and
held again when the summary changed.

229
00:14:42.432 --> 00:14:47.891
The evidence an ISSO keeps is the scope
file, the pre-merge check, the findings,

230
00:14:47.891 --> 00:14:52.830
the plan and its requests, the sign-in
summary with the hash the D N five

231
00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:57.682
record cites, the alert definition,
and each run's manifest, all dated.

232
00:14:57.682 --> 00:15:00.758
Before you ship, work through
the chapter's checklist.

233
00:15:00.758 --> 00:15:06.630
Next is Module 7: convert to managed
identities and federation, Gate 5.
